    <briefdescription>
<para>Blueprintable double property override with lazy evaluation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Applies an arithmetic operator to a base value with cached result. Enables property modification without conflicting with runtime weapon system changes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
